    </region>
    <region left="0" top="4761" width="413" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The development of the drying shrinkage strain in time follows from:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="4788" width="209" height="30" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ε.cd.t</e>
          <e type="operand">t</e>
