    <region left="252" top="4788" width="480" height="30" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>\[REGION[f5271f396bbb4dfc97841a1462e3082f]]\ is a coefficient depending on the notional size \[REGION[9ed7805e9f2b4b3abc58e1706cedf867]]\ according to Table 3.1-6.</p>
        </content>
        <regions>
          <region id="f5271f396bbb4dfc97841a1462e3082f" left="2" top="0" width="26" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
