    <region left="162" top="8055" width="622" height="67" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="610" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>\[REGION[506d0edd046042ffab630a4ec5c6d928]]\  is the coefficient, that takes into account long term effects on the compressive strength as well as unfavorable effects resulting from the way of applying the load. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Recommended value is 1,</span> but in the general case the value of \[REGION[a74ed12d1ced49e58d84ff55f9004ec9]]\ should fall in the diapason between <span style="font-weight: bold;">0,8 and 1,0</span></p>
        </content>
        <regions>
          <region id="506d0edd046042ffab630a4ec5c6d928" left="2" top="0" width="32" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
            <math>
